.SH "نام (NAME)"
hugin_lensdb \- Tool for lens database maintenance
.SH "نحوه استفاده (USAGE)"
.IX Header "USAGE"
.IP "\fBhugin_lensdb [\-\-recursive] \-\-populate BASEPATH\fR" 4
.IX Item "hugin_lensdb [--recursive] --populate BASEPATH"
Populate database with information from all pto files in given BASEPATH.
With the \-\-recursive switch all subfolders/directories will also be searched.
.IP "\fBhugin_lensdb \-\-compress\fR" 4
.IX Item "hugin_lensdb --compress"
Compresses the database by replacing single values with averaged values.
.IP "\fBhugin_lensdb \-\-remove\-lens=LENS\fR" 4
.IX Item "hugin_lensdb --remove-lens=LENS"
Removes given lens from the database.
.IP "\fBhugin_lensdb \-\-remove\-camera=MAKER|MODEL\fR" 4
.IX Item "hugin_lensdb --remove-camera=MAKER|MODEL"
Removes given camera from the database.
.IP "\fBhugin_lensdb \-\-export\-database=FILENAME\fR" 4
.IX Item "hugin_lensdb --export-database=FILENAME"
Export data from database to external file.
.IP "\fBhugin_lensdb \-\-import\-from\-file=FILENAME\fR" 4
.IX Item "hugin_lensdb --import-from-file=FILENAME"
Import data from external file.
.IP \fB\-h\fR 4
.IX Item "-h"
Shows help.
.PP
Thomas Modes
